			"Message": "chore(deps): Update GitHub Actions and submodule dependencies\n\nThis commit updates several GitHub Actions used in the project's CI workflows to their latest versions:\n- `actions/checkout` updated from v4.2.2 to v6.0.1 across all workflow files.\n- `ad-m/github-push-action` updated from v0.8.0 to v1.0.0 in Auto.yml.\n- `actions/setup-node` updated from v4.4.0 to v6.1.0 in both NPM.yml and Node.yml.\n- `pnpm/action-setup` updated from v4.1.0 to v4.2.0 in Node.yml.\n- `actions/upload-artifact` updated from v4.6.2 to v6.0.0 in Node.yml.\n- `actions/cache` updated from v4.2.3 to v5.0.1 in Rust.yml.\n\nAdditionally, the Microsoft submodule has been updated to the latest commit (59f41800), incorporating recent changes from its repository.\n\nThe `--provenance` flag was removed from the `npm publish` command in NPM.yml due to compatibility issues or changed requirements.",
